---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Craig Walton – Software Engineer"
  description="Craig Walton, independent software engineer in Aberdeen, Scotland, taking on contract work remotely and on-site."
>
  <h1>Craig Walton</h1>
  <p class="lede">Independent software engineer in Aberdeen, Scotland.</p>
  <p>
    I take on contract software engineering work, remotely or on-site, from applications and backend
    systems to developer tooling and infrastructure.
  </p>

  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <ul class="projects">
    <li>
      <h3>
        <a href="https://inspect.aisi.org.uk/">Inspect AI</a>
      </h3>
      <p>
        Contributed to UK AI Security Institute's open-source Python framework for large language
        model evaluations. Developed its sandboxed compute environments on Docker and Kubernetes,
        including <a href="https://k8s-sandbox.aisi.org.uk/">Inspect K8s Sandbox</a>.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>
        <a href="https://meridianlabs-ai.github.io/inspect_flow/">Inspect Flow</a> and
        <a href="https://meridianlabs-ai.github.io/inspect_scout/">Inspect Scout</a>
      </h3>
      <p>
        Open-source Python packages built on Inspect AI, for
        <a href="https://www.meridianlabs.ai/">Meridian Labs</a>: Inspect Flow runs AI evaluations
        at scale and Inspect Scout analyses the resulting agent transcripts. Ongoing contributions
        across both, from public APIs and data formats to CLI tooling and fixes.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Evaluation platform, UK AI Security Institute</h3>
      <p>
        AWS infrastructure for evaluating pre-release frontier models to tight timescales: staff
        compute, Kubernetes clusters, public-facing research studies and ETL pipelines.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Race strategy software, Red Bull Racing</h3>
      <p>
        Real-time strategy and car-performance analysis tools used on the pit wall, in the garage
        and at the factory, fed by live timing, GPS, weather and race-control data over Kafka.
        C#/.NET desktop front-ends with C# and Python services on Kubernetes.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Personal projects</h3>
      <p>
        <a href="https://craigwalton.github.io/PropertyExplorer/">Property Explorer</a>, a
        photorealistic 3D map of properties for sale built in React with Python data pipelines;
        <a href="https://craigwalton.github.io/MortgageSim/">Mortgage Sim</a>, a buy-versus-rent
        simulator in C#; and
        <a href="https://craigwalton.github.io/ClimateExplorer/">Climate Explorer</a>, an
        interactive React infographic of Earth's climate system.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have a project you'd like to discuss, I'd be glad to hear from you.</p>
  <dl class="contact">
    <div>
      <dt>Email</dt>
      <dd>
        <a id="email-link"></a>
        <noscript>craig.w [at] me.com</noscript>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>GitHub</dt>
      <dd>
        <a href="https://github.com/craigwalton">github.com/craigwalton</a>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>LinkedIn</dt>
      <dd>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/craigwalton1">linkedin.com/in/craigwalton1</a>
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <script>
    const link = document.getElementById("email-link") as HTMLAnchorElement;
    const address = ["craig.w", "me.com"].join("@");
    link.href = `mailto:${address}`;
    link.textContent = address;
  </script>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 3rem 0 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .projects {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .projects h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .projects p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .projects h3 a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .projects h3 a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .contact {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .contact dt {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .contact dd {
    margin: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
</style>
